version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-05"
abstract: >-
  Code, saved weights, selected submissions and a 37-page report for the 2026 IEEE Big Data Cup TrafficFlowBench
  competition. State is reconstructed by gradient-boosted trees on the residual of temporal interpolation; queue onsets
  and ongoing queues are forecast from twelve legal history slots by expected-IoU decisions over training analogues;
  path flows are an exact split-specific non-negative least-squares solve.
keywords:
  - traffic state estimation
  - queue forecasting
  - fundamental diagram
  - LWR conservation
  - analogue forecasting
  - gradient boosting
  - origin-destination estimation
  - reproducibility
